{{ id | upper }}
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The complete user guide of the {{ id | upper }} can be found at the
:adi:`{{ id | upper }} manual <{{ manual }}>`. This section only describes
the settings needed to set up the boards.

Power supply ({{ power.jumper }})
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Jumper **{{ power.jumper }}** selects the power input of the SoM.

.. list-table::
   :header-rows: 1

   * - Mode
     - {{ power.jumper }}
     - Power input
   * - Standalone
     - {{ power.standalone }}
     - {{ power.standalone_input }}
   * - On a carrier board
     - {{ power.carrier }}
     - SoM 2.0 connector, from the carrier board

Boot mode ({{ boot.switch }})
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Switch **{{ boot.switch }}** selects the boot mode of the processor. Use
position {{ boot.jtag_position }} to bootstrap the processor over JTAG, as
described in :ref:`adsp setup`, and position {{ boot.flash_position }} to boot
U-Boot from the flash after it is installed.

.. list-table::
   :header-rows: 1

   * - Position
     - Boot mode
{% for position, mode in boot.modes %}
   * - {{ position }}
     - {{ mode }}
{% endfor %}

.. important::

   The JTAG interface of the processor on the {{ id | upper }} runs at
   {{ jtag_voltage }}. Set the voltage of an external ICE to {{ jtag_voltage }}
   before connecting it. See :ref:`adsp-jtag`.

